{"ts":"2026-07-28T04:20:05.459Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"50f20f40420211fd4a9904be","agent_provenance":{"model":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-huolbk"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-784: SDK blueprint preflight misses host-owned flag collisions and malformed long-flag tokens"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Align author-time extension lint and preflight with loader enforcement. lintExtensionBlueprint and assertExtensionPreflight currently return clean reports for a blueprint whose --json declaration is rejected at activation, and neither validator rejects malformed long tokens such as verbose or -v. Add one shared host-owned flag collision rule and explicit long-token grammar so static preflight cannot approve a blueprint the runtime quarantines."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:extensions","area:sdk","author-ergonomics","contracts","github-report"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-28T04:20:05.459Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-28T04:20:05.459Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":180},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"lintExtensionBlueprint emits an error-severity host-owned flag collision finding for primary and alias tokens in SUBCOMMAND_GLOBAL_FLAG_CONTRACTS; assertExtensionPreflight surfaces the same failure and remediation as runtime activation; FlagDefinition.long rejects tokens outside the canonical double-dash grammar at author-time and activation boundaries; valid custom flags remain accepted; SDK types docs fixtures property tests and installed-extension acceptance tests stay aligned"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-ugqx"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reporter","value":"github-issue-784"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/environment","value":"Published @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.7.28 in a clean installed consumer"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Lint and preflight an extension blueprint declaring --json, verbose, or -v as FlagDefinition.long, then compare activation behavior."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"Static preflight rejects every loader-invalid host-owned or malformed long flag with the same actionable remediation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Static lint/preflight report no findings for --json while activation rejects it, and malformed long tokens are accepted and stored verbatim."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"sdk:extension-blueprint-preflight"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/customer_impact","value":"Extension authors can publish a blueprint after the purpose-built preflight reports success, then lose the affected command or extension surface only at activation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-9ect","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-28T04:20:05.459Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-gnowgi","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-07-28T04:20:05.459Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-ill9gv","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-28T04:20:05.459Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-w7mqzt","kind":"verifies","created_at":"2026-07-28T04:20:05.459Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-28T04:20:05.459Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate-check evidence 2026-07-28: all-status searches for blueprint lint host-owned flag collision, assertExtensionPreflight, GH-719, and GH-764 found closed author-time lint feature pm-9ect and closed runtime collision owners pm-ill9gv/pm-gnowgi, but no active owner for the static-preflight parity and malformed long-token gaps reported in GH-784. Created as the canonical open follow-up; not claimed or implemented in the current PR."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"dfe29ecf5805a2047babb0d4ee4a7c2a3aa9b2522140c6e959c1b426f22f9d32","message":""}
